# Architecture

Dependency direction:

- `src/app` imports feature screens from `@/features/<name>` only.
- Feature `ui` imports own `domain`, `@/common`, `@/core/theme`, `@/core/state`, and `useDependencies()`.
- Feature `data` imports own `domain` and `core` ports.
- Feature `domain` imports only own domain and `@/utils`.
- `src/core` is the only layer that imports third-party libraries.
- `src/di/container.ts` is the only place that constructs adapters and repository implementations.

Features never import `zustand`, `react-native-mmkv`, `expo-location`, `expo-notifications`, or `expo-linking`.
